# Not actually read by the app (GA_MEASUREMENT_ID in layout.tsx is
# hardcoded) -- documents the real value in use for reference. Shares the
# app's own GA4 property (account "Pulse", account id 403209054, property
# id 549937509), not a separate landing-only property.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-KVRWEVKP6Y

# HubSpot Private App token, server-side only (never expose as NEXT_PUBLIC_*).
